WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 dbfde1b9a925870aa288cbb83eacc2ca

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.909
Sawa, karibu tena. Umetatua zoezi lako la kwanza

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.720
kwenye Jiki. Hongera. Hilo ndilo zoezi rahisi zaidi

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.060
utakalowahi kufanya. Kwa kweli, huenda

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.360
lilionekana rahisi mno. Huenda unajiuliza

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.340
kama hii kweli ni kupanga programu, na kupanga

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.720
programu halisi kuko wapi. Basi, kama

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.590
kionjo tu cha yajayo, katika mazoezi

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.060
20 au 30 hivi tu kuanzia sasa, utakuwa umejifunza

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.290
vya kutosha kuunda programu ambapo

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.380
mhusika wako atajiongoza mwenyewe ndani ya mzingile.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.670
Ataweza kuangalia anakoelekea,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.250
ataweza kusogea huku na huko

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.800
na kutafuta njia ya kutoka peke yake.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.440
Hicho ndicho utakachoweza kuunda.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.300
Kozi hii inahusu kujenga kidogo

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:45.180
kidogo, hatua kwa hatua, na kuacha maarifa yakusanyike

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.960
akilini mwako hadi uweze kwa kweli

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.900
kujenga vitu vinavyokushangaza. Kwa hiyo,

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.680
katika somo hili, tutazingatia kile

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.640
kilichotokea hasa ulipoendesha msimbo

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.000
uliouandika. Unapoandika msimbo,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.280
unachofanya kwa kweli ni kueleza unachotaka

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.820
kitokee, kwa lugha ambayo kompyuta

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.700
inaielewa. Sasa, kuna lugha nyingi tofauti

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:11.820
za programu, na kuna wakalimani wengi tofauti

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.800
wanaochukua kile unachoandika na kukibadilisha

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:17.760
kuwa moja na sifuri ambazo kompyuta

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.540
inaweza kuzielewa. Katika kozi hii, mkalimani wako ni

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.960
Jiki. Kozi yote imepewa jina la Jiki.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.300
Huyu ni Jiki. Jiki atakuwa rafiki yako

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:30.280
katika safari hii ya kujifunza kupanga programu. Kazi yake

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:33.860
ni kufasiri msimbo unaoandika na

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.700
kuubadilisha kuwa moja na sifuri

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.460
ambazo kompyuta inaweza kuzitekeleza. Lengo

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:42.460
kuu la kupanga programu ni kumpa mkalimani, ambaye

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:46.280
hapa ni Jiki, maagizo sahihi. Kuna

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:49.710
maagizo mengi tofauti unayoweza

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.600
kumpa Jiki, mengi ambayo anayaelewa. Anaweza

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.830
kuunganisha vitu pamoja, anaweza kufanya kitu

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.810
mara nyingi, anaweza kusema, “Kama hili litatokea,

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.880
basi ninahitaji kufanya hili.” Anaweza

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.480
kukumbuka vitu na kuvitumia tena baadaye.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.200
Anaweza kukupa hitilafu kama kitu

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.720
hakiko sawa. Tutaangalia mambo haya yote

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.740
tofauti katika kozi hii. Lakini jambo

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:16.670
la muhimu kuelewa ni kwamba kila kitu

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:20.300
utakachofanya ni kuweka maagizo kwenye

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.040
ubao ili Jiki aje na kuyafuata.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.120
Nilipojifunza kupanga programu miaka 34 iliyopita,

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.640
hii ndiyo modeli ya kiakili niliyojenga,

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.960
na ndiyo hiyo hiyo ninayoitumia hadi leo.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.800
Ninaelewa jinsi kompyuta zinavyofanya kazi

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.540
hadi kwenye kiwango cha moja na sifuri, lakini

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.520
kwa kweli sifikirii hilo kamwe.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.600
Kichwani mwangu, kuna mtu mdogo anayeishi

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.360
ndani ya kompyuta, na mimi ninamwambia afanye nini.

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.549
Kwa hiyo, ningependa twende

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.440
pamoja katika hili. Ni modeli ya kiakili yenye nguvu

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.820
ambayo unaweza kuijenga, na nadhani

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.540
ukianza kufikiria mambo kwa

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.970
njia hii ya picha, kuhusu kile ambacho mtu aliyeko

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.380
ndani ya kompyuta anafanya, itakusaidia

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.020
sana unapojifunza

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.220
kupanga programu. Hebu tuanze kwa kuangalia

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.240
mojawapo ya dhana za msingi katika kupanga programu,

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:11.740
inayoitwa vitendakazi. Vitendakazi ni kama mashine ndogo

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:14.040
ambazo unaweza kumwambia Jiki azitumie. Na tukiangalia

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.630
ndani ya ghala la Jiki, ambapo yeye hupenda

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.580
kukaa, utaona ana rafu

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.480
yenye mashine tatu tofauti: move, turnLeft,

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.820
na turnRight. Katika zoezi ulilolitatua

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.380
sasa hivi, ulipoandika move na kisha

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.220
mabano yale mawili, ulichokuwa unafanya ni kumwambia

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.380
Jiki aende achukue mashine ya move

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.040
kutoka rafuni, azungushe mpini, aiwashe,

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.860
na aitumie. Ulipoandika

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:39.000
turnLeft na kisha mabano,

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.880
ulikuwa unamwambia Jiki achukue mashine ya

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:44.049
turnLeft kutoka rafuni na aitumie. Na

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.440
huu ni mtindo utakaoutumia

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.380
tena na tena. Kila unapotaka

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.500
kutumia mashine, utaandika jina lake

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.980
na kisha mabano yale, na hilo linamwambia Jiki

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.820
aende achukue mashine na

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:59.170
aitumie. Sasa, jinsi mashine hiyo inavyofanya kazi,

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.440
kinachotokea ndani ya mashine, hatuhitaji

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.260
kujali hilo kwa sasa. Nakuahidi

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.340
tutaliangalia hilo kwa undani

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.460
zaidi baadaye. Kwa kweli, hivi karibuni

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.360
utaweza kutengeneza mashine zako mwenyewe

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:11.030
pia. Lakini kwa sasa, usijali kuhusu

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.340
hilo. Kwa kila zoezi, utaambiwa mashine zipi

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:17.060
zilizo kwenye rafu ya Jiki. Zitakuwa tofauti

00:04:17.079 --> 00:04:19.680
kwa kila zoezi, na utaweza

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.680
kutumia mashine hizo kutatua mazoezi.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.660
Kwa mfano, katika zoezi linalofuata,

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.920
utakuwa na mashine mbili, move na shoot,

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.320
na utazitumia kuwadungua

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.810
viumbe wa angani. Nenda ukafurahie, na

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.270
kisha tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.080
na tutachunguza dhana inayofuata.
